   696→- "'`src/cli/commands/item.ts:875` (also applies to `implements` and `depends_on` paths): duplicate prevention is raw-string based (`includes(options.<ref>)`). The same target item can be added multiple times using different valid reference forms (`@slug`, `@ULID`, short ULID).
